error[RT035]: cannot convert Infinity to JSON
  --> json-infinity.lm:12:7
   |
12 | print(stringify(sales))
   |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: it is at $.total, where `$` is the value you passed
   = note: JSON has no way to write Infinity, and `null` would be a lie: it is how JSON spells a value that is not there
   = note: this usually means an earlier result overflowed
